NAME='SHAHRAM AJLOO';TITLE='Associate Partner · Operational Transformation';CONTACT='+45 93 99 95 14 · ajlooshahram@gmail.com · linkedin.com/in/shahramajloo · Måløv, Denmark'
def build(path):
 m=MasterDoc(os.path.join(ROOT,'Shahram_Ajloo_NNE_DepartmentManagerEI.docx'),lang='en-GB')
 m.header_banner(NAME,TITLE,CONTACT);m.meta('Valcon · Associate Partner and Competence Team Lead, Operational Transformation · Copenhagen')
 p=m._p(spacing_after=80,line=260,justify=False);m._run(p,'Application: Four commitments, one measurable change',bold=True,color='1A1A1A')
 def para(t):m.para(t,after=45,line=238)
 para('**The client sees one transformation, even when it depends on four commitments:** a team that can deliver, a relationship worth extending, an engagement that achieves its outcomes, and a service that improves with each assignment. For Valcon’s business transformation and Operational Transformation practice, the challenge is to advance all four together as demand for process redesign, automation and agentic AI grows.')
 para('**Shape the work around the business problem.** Before choosing technology, map the process with the people who operate it, agree a baseline and identify where delay, rework or risk matters to the client. Form a joint outcome and a realistic delivery scope with an owner for adoption and benefits. This reflects Valcon’s combination of consulting, data and technology: a solution is useful when the client can operate and improve it after handover.')
 para('**Deliver with the team, then expand on evidence.** For the approximately 12 consultants, regular individual conversations, clear expectations and shared learning can connect development with project needs. In parallel, protect time for client relationships and commercial opportunities: listen for adjacent needs, develop proposals with colleagues and agree any next phase against evidence from the work already delivered. A joint review of pipeline, delivery, capacity and capability would keep those four responsibilities in balance.')
 para('The foundation combines technical operations and client-facing work. At ELOHVAC, full P&L, quotations, client relationships and leading eight employees connect commercial decisions to delivery. At Novo Nordisk, 25 specialists and 37 concurrent capital projects required coordination, financial control and documented handover. My experience also includes leading consultants and selling client work, including at Novo and ELOHVAC; the scope and specific engagements can be discussed. The scale and commercial expectations of Valcon’s practice would be agreed with the Partner.')
 para('**Build the offer as well as the project.** At Data Power, a team of 4–10 developed technical applications from client requirements and integration to documented handover. The work included customer solutions using LLM APIs and AI agents; I led the work and contributed to development and delivery. At ELOHVAC, AI-assisted planning and quality tools produced a documented productivity improvement of over 40%. For Valcon, I would combine process discovery, data, automation and agentic options with human review, clear ownership and a practical route into the client’s operations — not assume an agent is the answer to every problem.')
 para('Valcon’s no-nonsense culture and emphasis on work from strategy to operations fit the discipline this role requires: clear decisions, collaborative delivery and results that can be sustained. I would welcome a discussion about the team’s capability priorities, its clients’ most pressing needs and how to grow the practice responsibly. I work in English and Danish and am available for client and project travel in the Nordic region.')
 m.meta('Kind regards',after=5);m.meta('Shahram Ajloo · +45 93 99 95 14 · ajlooshahram@gmail.com',after=0)
 m.page_break();m.resume_header(NAME,TITLE,CONTACT,'THE PRACTICE — CONNECT PEOPLE, CLIENTS, DELIVERY AND CAPABILITY')
 m.para('Operational transformation requires process redesign, a credible business case and delivery that sticks. Relevant foundation: ELOHVAC full P&L and eight employees; Data Power AI department of 4–10 delivering technical applications and AI-agent solutions; Novo Nordisk coordination of 25 specialists across 37 projects. The work includes consulting-team leadership, commercial client work and agent-solution leadership and delivery; the scale of a large consulting practice is not documented.',after=30)
 m.section('SHAPE, DELIVER, EXPAND — APPROACH TO THE ROLE')
 for a,b in [('Team and capability','Use 1:1s, clear priorities, coaching and shared project learning to develop an inclusive team and strengthen consulting, process and technology skills.'),('Clients and delivery','Agree the problem, baseline, scope, owners and quality controls; mobilise a cross-functional team and review outcomes with the client through handover.'),('Commercial growth and services','Develop proposals and client relationships alongside delivery; turn lessons into repeatable methods for process redesign, data and responsible agentic automation.')]:m.bullet(a,b,after=10)
 m.section('EXPERIENCE')
 jobs=[('Owner / Technical Director','ELOHVAC ApS · Copenhagen · May 2023–present','8 employees including 3 apprentices · full P&L',[('Commercial and delivery','Manage quotations, client work, materials, subcontractors, project economics and handover; lead five electricians and three apprentices with regular 1:1s.'),('Process and automation','Built AI-assisted estimating, schedules, quality checklists and KPI tools; documented productivity improvement of over 40%.')]),('Co-owner and CTO / Technical Lead, AI department','Data Power Consultant ApS · Copenhagen · 2024–Nov 2026 · alongside ELOHVAC','4–10 people · company ceased in November 2026',[('Client solutions','Led technical and industrial applications from requirements, architecture and integration to implementation, documentation and customer handover.'),('AI and capability','Led and contributed to customer solutions using LLM APIs and AI agents; introduced AI-assisted coding with review and testing standards and applied AI to management reporting.')]),('Senior Commissioning Engineer / Project Manager, electrical systems','Novo Nordisk A/S · Nov 2022–Jul 2024','37 concurrent CAPEX projects · 25 specialists',[('Complex delivery','Coordinated engineering, procurement and construction, managing progress, cost and risk; FAT/SAT and IQ/OQ/PQ under GMP/FDA/EMA with zero critical deviations at handover.')]),('Project and Workshop Manager','Ventek-Air · Jan 2022–Nov 2022','14 people · 11 concurrent projects',[('People and improvement','Led workload and capacity planning, used team meetings and bottleneck analysis, and coordinated subcontractors and project delivery.')]),('Operations and Maintenance Manager / Workshop Technician','BIOFOS, Lynetten · Aug 2017–Jan 2022','Critical 24/7 operations',[('Operational excellence','Applied 5S, standard work and PDCA to maintenance and spare-parts processes alongside technical operations.')]),('Electromechanical Technician / Production Team Lead','ARJ Engineering · Dec 2003–Mar 2010','12 mechanics and technicians',[('Team and operations','Led shift planning and material coordination, diagnosis and corrective action on industrial equipment.')])]
 for t,meta,scope,bullets in jobs:
  m.job(t,meta,scope=scope)
  for a,b in bullets:m.bullet(a,b,after=10)
 m.page_break();m.section('EDUCATION, METHODS AND LANGUAGES')
 for a,b in [('B.Tech, Technology Management and Mechanical Engineering','Copenhagen School of Marine and Technical Engineering · 2017–2022'),('PRINCE2 certified project manager','AXELOS / PeopleCert'),('Authorised Danish maskinmester, LV/MV/HV','Danish Safety Technology Authority · 2023'),('Electrical and mechanical engineering design, electrical engineering','Tehran Technical University · EQF 6 · 2000–2003')]:m.edu(a,b)
 m.para('**Methods:** PRINCE2, Lean and Six Sigma applied in practice; only PRINCE2 is certified. **Digital:** Python, Claude API, LLM APIs and AI agents; SAP ERP and Excel. **Languages:** professional English, Danish and Persian. **Travel:** available for Nordic client and project travel.',after=20)
 rows=[('Team leadership and inclusive development','ELOHVAC: eight employees and 1:1s; Data Power: AI department of 4–10. Consulting-team leadership is confirmed; would agree development and feedback with each of Valcon’s consultants.'),('Commercial growth and client partnerships','ELOHVAC: quotations, client relationships and full P&L; new sales and client development experience is confirmed. Specific consulting sales figures and account scope are not documented.'),('Client engagement from mobilisation to delivery','Data Power: client requirements, integration and handover; Novo: 37 projects, 25 specialists and zero critical deviations at handover. Define scope, decisions and outcome owners at mobilisation.'),('Service development, AI, data and technology','Data Power: AI-assisted coding standards and customer LLM/agent applications. Would develop reusable process and delivery methodologies with Valcon’s data and technology specialists.'),('Process redesign, improvement and automation','BIOFOS: 5S and PDCA in operations; ELOHVAC: AI-assisted planning and quality work with over 40% productivity improvement. Map client processes and validate outcomes before scaling.'),('Agentic automation and responsible implementation','Customer AI-agent solution leadership, development and delivery are confirmed. Client use case and quantitative results are not specified; agree oversight, ownership and operational controls for each proposed use.'),('Strategic, analytical and pragmatic execution','ELOHVAC: quotations and full P&L; Novo: project budget, risks and monthly reporting. Would connect opportunity assessment and investment decisions to realistic execution and measured outcomes.'),('People skills, empathy and clear communication','ELOHVAC: 1:1s and structured training; Ventek-Air: 14 people across 11 projects. Would listen, agree expectations and invite challenge while maintaining clear delivery decisions.'),('Autonomy and balance across four areas','Full P&L and concurrent leadership of ELOHVAC and Data Power required shared priorities. Would review team development, commercial pipeline, delivery and service capability together.'),('Education, English and Danish','B.Tech in Technology Management and Mechanical Engineering; PRINCE2 certification. Professional English and Danish support written and verbal client and team communication.'),('Nordic client travel and Copenhagen base','Based in Måløv, Denmark; available for client meetings and project travel in the Nordic region. Copenhagen is the intended office location.'),('Associate Partner scope and practice growth','Leadership and commercial experience spans ELOHVAC and Novo; specific scale of consulting sales and practice growth should be discussed with Valcon.')]
 m.models_table('ROLE NEEDS — EVIDENCE AND APPROACH',('Requirement','Evidence or proposed approach'),rows,widths=(2600,7746))
 m.section('INITIAL PRIORITIES WITH THE PARTNER AND TEAM')
 for t in ['Listen to consultants and clients; understand the active portfolio, development needs, delivery risks and commercial priorities.', 'Agree an integrated rhythm for people, pipeline, live engagements and service capability; identify one process-to-automation opportunity with a clear client owner.', 'Review results and adoption with the client, and turn suitable learning into a reusable offer with Valcon’s consulting, data and technology colleagues.']:m.bullet('',t,after=10)
